## 🧪 Testing

### Run Test Suite

```bash
# All tests
pytest tests/ -v

# Integration tests only
pytest tests/integration/ -v

# With coverage
pytest tests/ -v --cov=src --cov-report=html

# View coverage
open htmlcov/index.html
```

### Verification Scripts

```bash
# Verify lowering correctness
./verify_lowering.sh

# Test all backends
./test_all_backends.sh

# Compare outputs
./show_all_outputs.sh
```

