## 🎯 Backend Capabilities

| Feature | ngspice | HSPICE | Spectre |
|---------|---------|--------|---------|
| Density models (`cj`/`cjsw`) | ❌ → Primitives | ❌ → Primitives | ✅ Native |
| Expression capacitors | ✅ `C{expr}` | ✅ `C='expr'` | ✅ Native |
| Statistics blocks | ❌ → `.param/.func` | ❌ → `.param/.func` | ✅ Native |
| Random functions | `gauss()` | `agauss()` | Both |

